{"id": "EUVD-2026-96587", "enisaUuid": "c315afcd-3254-3966-bc80-86c56a79f333", "description": "JeecgBoot through 3.9.5 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the GET /sys/api/getDynamicDbSourceByCode endpoint of SystemApiController, which lacks Shiro permission or role annotations. Any authenticated low-privileged user can supply datasource codes in the dbSourceCode parameter to retrieve JDBC URLs, usernames and decrypted cleartext database passwords.", "datePublished": "2026-10-10T21:49:37", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T02:36:43", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/AnkesKasty/cve-request-poc/blob/a7b6d1423555812d8efa26c91c5d0683164b31e5/JeecgBoot/poc_sys_api_credential_family.py", "https://github.com/jeecgboot/JeecgBoot/blob/e3b9dc0aefe1943d9772b026f64ed671a7c82802/jeecg-boot/jeecg-module-system/jeecg-system-biz/src/main/java/org/jeecg/modules/api/controller/SystemApiController.java#L358-L361", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/jeecgboot-through-3.9.5-missing-authorization-via-getdynamicdbsourcebycode-endpoint"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-108648", "GHSA-xqq5-rxcj-4fmx"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.29, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "873d36f8-9fe0-36b9-bdd1-09ccbe344448", "product": {"name": "JeecgBoot", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.9.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "cf15a6c2-591b-37e9-8676-7cc0c96fd5af", "vendor": {"name": "jeecgboot"}}], "isExploited": false}